    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d8-a2">

                <pb facs="0057" n="7" xml:id="pg7"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 23.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Buchanan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Buchanan is instructed to exert all legitimate influence to induce Argentina
                    to enact laws favorable to the commerce of the United States and equitably
                    responsive to the concessions made by Congress.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
